cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
title: "MeshKit"
message: "If you use MeshKit, developed by HydroCouple, please cite the version you used as below."
abstract: >-
  MeshKit, developed by HydroCouple, is an open-source library for generating
  and checking unstructured two-dimensional meshes: constrained Delaunay
  triangulation, mixed triangle and quadrilateral meshes with mapped patches,
  size fields, bilinear terrain certificates, and streaming MKB and SMS 2DM
  file I/O. It provides Qt-free C++17 targets, optional Qt adapters, Python
  bindings and a command-line tool.
authors:
